---
source: tests/instas.rs
expression: "format!(\"{e:?}\")"
---
  x in comment on line 2
  |-> in Y-Statement starting on line 2
  `-> ADR change entries are not in chronological order
    ,-[13:1]
 10 | Here's a tail.
 11 | 
 12 | 2023-12-02: changed thing 2
 13 | 2023-12-03: changed thing 3
    : ^^^^^^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    :              `-- this entry should come after the one below it
 14 | 2023-12-01: changed thing 1
    `----
  help: sort the change entries such that they are listed from oldest to newest

